  #line-at(72.024pt, 83.78pt, "1. Introduction")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72.024pt, 100.1pt, "Magnetic tunnel junctions, as the cornerstone of spintronic memory architecture, exploit ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 116.42pt, "tunneling magnetoresistance by typically controlling the relative alignment of magnetization ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 132.62pt, "states of ferromagnetic layers between parallel (low resistance) and antiparallel (high ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 148.94pt, "resistance) configurations. In recent years, the emergence of two-dimensional materials has ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 165.26pt, "heralded a new paradigm for MTJ due to their unique properties, such as atomically smooth ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 181.58pt, "interfaces and suppressed intermixing with neighboring materials")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 6.48pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(331.39pt, 178.1pt, "1,2")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(339.58pt, 181.58pt, ". Recently, breakthroughs, ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 197.9pt, "like giant TMR and good electrical tunability, have been made utilizing 2D magnets")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 6.48pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(431.88pt, 194.42pt, "3–5")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(441.6pt, 197.9pt, ", ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 214.25pt, "however, it remains a challenge to achieve TMR at high temperatures due to their limited ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 230.45pt, "Curie temperatures")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 6.48pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(148.49pt, 226.97pt, "6–12")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(161.45pt, 230.45pt, ".  ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 247.49pt, "Meanwhile, anti-ferromagnetic materials have attracted interest in spintronic studies owing to ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 265.13pt, "their excellent properties (e.g., ultrafast terahertz (THz) spin dynamics, good magnetic field ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 282.65pt, "immunity, and no identifiable stray fields)")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 6.48pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(244.39pt, 279.17pt, "13,14")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(258.91pt, 282.65pt, ". Recently, sizable TMR at room temperature ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 300.29pt, "has been realized based on 3D anti-ferromagnetic materials (e.g., Mn")
